  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math> is the normal at a point on the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi></math> whose focal distance is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn></math>&nbsp;units, then <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to:",
