  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the point on the parabola be <math> <mrow> <mi>P</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo> <mrow> <mi>a</mi><msup> <mi>t</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow> <mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow> </math> where <math> <mrow> <mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2.</mn></mrow> </math><br /><br />Given distance of this point from focus be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn></math>&nbsp;units<br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn> <mo>&#8658;</mo> <msup><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=&#160;&#160;&#177;</mo><mi></mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math><br /><br />Since <math> <mrow> <mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow> </math> is normal to the parabola<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup> <mi>t</mi> <mn>3</mn> </msup> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>",
